DGF
Vertex % Coordinates, volumes and boundary flags of the pore bodies
parameters 3
% Vertex parameters: PoreInscribedRadius PoreVolume PoreLabel
% Element parameters: ThroatInscribedRadius ThroatLength ThroatLabel
0 0 0.0002 6.4e-11 1
0 0.0006 0.0002 6.4e-11 -1
0 0.0012 0.0002 6.4e-11 -1
0 0.0018 0.0002 6.4e-11 -1
0 0.0024 0.0002 6.4e-11 -1
0 0.003 0.0002 6.4e-11  2
#
SIMPLEX % Connections of the pore bodies (pore throats)
parameters 3
0 1 1.1e-4 0.0002 1
1 2 1.1e-4 0.0002 -1
2 3 1.1e-4 0.0002 -1
3 4 1.1e-4 0.0002 -1
4 5 1.1e-4 0.0002 2
#
